# E12 -- plan and predictions: reports/02_experiment_log.md §E12.
# Every model uses the current best settings (full question, 1024 tokens, 16 epochs);
# what each learns (--task) and how much data it sees (--val-frac) is on its lane line:
#   E12a_alldata       the 9-way model on ALL of train (no held-out slice), last epoch
#   E12b_gate          Non-Reply vs the rest                      } combined by
#   E12b_other6        6-way, non-Non-Reply rows only             } hier_combine.py
#   E12b_nr3           3-way, Non-Reply rows only                 }
#   E12c_pair_*        boundary experts for the three most-confused pairs
# Controls already exist: E10_fullq_16ep seeds 0-2 (same settings, same seeds).

--model microsoft/deberta-v3-large
--batch-size 16
--lr 1e-5
--head-lr 1e-4
--llrd 0.95
--loss ce
--input full
--max-len 1024
--a-budget 256
--epochs 16

# operational (1024-token runs peak at ~15-17 GB)
--max-vram-gb 18
--save-model
--push-to-hub
